msgstr "用於本地提供者的 HuggingFace 模型 ID，或特定端點的模型 ID"

msgid "Enable cross-file rerank"
msgstr "啟用跨檔案重新排序 (rerank)"

msgid ""
"Second-stage cross-encoder after hybrid retrieve (Embeddings + FTS and "
"LlamaIndex). Off by default."
msgstr ""
"在混合檢索（嵌入 + FTS 與 LlamaIndex）後的第二階段交叉編碼器。預設為關閉。"

msgid "Rerank model"
msgstr "重新排序模型"

msgid ""
"Used only when rerank is enabled. English MiniLM is fast; bge-reranker-v2-m3 "
"is multilingual and downloads ~2.3 GB."
msgstr ""
"僅在啟用重新排序時使用。英文 MiniLM 速度較快；bge-reranker-v2-m3 支援多語言，"
"下載大小約 2.3 GB。"

msgid "cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2"
msgstr "cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2"

msgid "BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3"
msgstr "BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3"

msgid "Core services (config, events, logging)"
msgstr "核心服務 (設定、事件、日誌)"

msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

msgid "Enable MCP Server"
msgstr "啟用 MCP 伺服器"

msgid ""
"Localhost only, no auth. Clients use http://localhost:<port>/mcp (streamable "
"HTTP)."
msgstr ""
"僅限本機，無需驗證。用戶端使用 http://localhost:<port>/mcp (可串流 HTTP)。"

msgid "MCP Port"
msgstr "MCP 連接埠"

msgid "Tool Exposure"
msgstr "工具公開"

msgid ""
"How specialized tools are surfaced to MCP clients. delegate=reached via the "
"delegate gateway (today's behavior); direct_flat=all MCP-reachable "
"specialized tools listed directly, excluding sidebar-only flows (best for "
"clients with their own tool-search); direct_discovery=small core list plus "
"find_tools (domain catalog, then per-domain tool schemas; best for any "
"client)."
msgstr ""
"專用工具如何呈現給 MCP 客戶端。delegate=透過委派閘道存取（目前行為）；"
"direct_flat=所有可透過 MCP 存取的專用工具直接列出，排除僅限側邊欄的流程（最適"
"合擁有自身工具搜尋功能的客戶端）；direct_discovery=小型核心列表加上 "
"find_tools（領域目錄，然後是各領域的工具架構；最適合任何客戶端）。"

msgid "Delegate (default)"
msgstr "委派 (預設)"

msgid "Direct — list all tools"
msgstr "直接 — 列出所有工具"

msgid "Direct — discovery (find_tools)"
msgstr "直接 — 探索 (find_tools)"

msgid "Public tunnel"
msgstr "公開通道"

msgid "Expose via public tunnel"
msgstr "透過公開通道公開"

msgid ""
"Requires the selected provider binary on PATH (cloudflared, bore, ngrok, or "
"tailscale). MCP has no auth — anyone with the public URL can call tools. See "
"MCP Server Status for the public /mcp URL when ready."
msgstr ""
"需要 PATH 中已安裝選定的提供者二進位檔（cloudflared、bore、ngrok 或 "
"tailscale）。MCP 沒有驗證機制 — 任何擁有公開 URL 的人都可以呼叫工具。準備就緒"
"後，請參閱 MCP 伺服器狀態以取得公開的 /mcp URL。"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "提供者"

msgid ""
"Cloudflare quick tunnel (default), Bore, Ngrok, or Tailscale Funnel (must "
"already be logged in)."
msgstr ""
"Cloudflare 快速通道（預設）、Bore、Ngrok 或 Tailscale Funnel（必須已登入）。"

msgid "Cloudflare"
msgstr "Cloudflare"

msgid "Bore"
msgstr "Bore"

msgid "Ngrok"
msgstr "Ngrok"

msgid "Tailscale"
msgstr "Tailscale"

msgid "Provider config"
msgstr "提供者設定"

msgid ""
"Ngrok authtoken; Cloudflare tunnel token; Bore server or 'server secret'. "
"Empty = provider default / CLI config. Unused for Tailscale."
msgstr ""
"Ngrok 驗證權杖；Cloudflare 通道權杖；Bore 伺服器或「伺服器密鑰」。留空則使用"
"提供者預設值或 CLI 設定。Tailscale 不使用此項。"

msgid "Client config (copy into Claude / Hermes-Agent):"
msgstr "用戶端設定（複製到 Claude / Hermes-Agent）："

msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

msgid "Python venv path"
msgstr "Python venv 路徑"

msgid ""
"If set, runs =PY() and Run Python Script in that venv (bin/python, Scripts/"
"python.exe, or conda/pyenv-win env-root python.exe). Paste the path without "
"surrounding quotes. If empty, uses this process's sys.executable (basic "
"stdlib); use a venv for numpy/pandas and Vision Helpers (paddleocr, "
"paddlepaddle)."
msgstr ""
"若已設定，則會在該 venv（bin/python、Scripts/python.exe 或 conda/pyenv-win "
"env-root python.exe）中執行 =PY() 與「執行 Python 指令碼」。請貼上路徑，且不"
"要包含引號。若留空，則使用此處理程序的 sys.executable（基礎標準函式庫）；若需"
"使用 numpy/pandas 與視覺輔助工具（paddleocr, paddlepaddle），請務必使用 "
"venv。"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "測試"

msgid "Download platform-specific audio and serialization binaries:"
msgstr "下載平台專用的音訊與序列化二進位檔案："

msgid "Python script timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Python 指令碼逾時（秒）"

msgid "Wall-clock limit for Run Python Script and =PYTHON() / =PY()."
msgstr "「執行 Python 指令碼」與 =PYTHON() / =PY() 的實際執行時間限制。"

msgid "Max Calc data cells"
msgstr "Calc 資料儲存格上限"

msgid ""
"Maximum cells in =PYTHON() data or Run Python Script data/data_range. Larger "
"values use more RAM and time; UNO range read still dominates."
msgstr ""
"=PYTHON() 資料或執行 Python 指令碼資料/資料範圍 (data/data_range) 的最大儲存"
"格數。較大的數值會消耗更多記憶體與時間；UNO 範圍讀取仍是主要的效能瓶頸。"

msgid "Python session mode"
msgstr "Python 工作階段模式"

msgid ""
"Isolated: each =PYTHON() cell gets a fresh namespace. Shared: one namespace "
"per workbook (variables carry between cells)."
msgstr ""
"隔離模式：每個 =PYTHON() 儲存格皆擁有獨立的命名空間。共用模式：每個活頁簿共用"
"一個命名空間（變數可在儲存格間傳遞）。"

msgid "Isolated (default)"
msgstr "隔離模式（預設）"

msgid "Geometric Recalc Order (Experimental)"
msgstr "幾何重新計算順序 (實驗性)"

msgid ""
"Ensures PY cells evaluate in sheet order. Most useful with Shared kernel."
msgstr "確保 PY 儲存格依工作表順序進行評估。在共用核心下最為實用。"

msgid "Python auto spill in Calc"
msgstr "Calc 中的 Python 自動溢出"

msgid ""
"Automatically spill multi-cell array/DataFrame results from =PYTHON() into "
"adjacent cells."
msgstr "自動將 =PYTHON() 的多儲存格陣列/資料框結果溢出至相鄰儲存格。"

msgid "Rewrite xl() ranges"
msgstr "重寫 xl() 範圍"

msgid ""
"On Edit Python in Cell save, lift static xl(\"A1:…\") onto =PY data args and "
"rewrite to data / data[i] / .to_pandas()."
msgstr ""
"在儲存格編輯 Python 儲存時，將靜態 xl(\"A1:…\") 提升至 =PY 資料引數，並重寫"
"為 data / data[i] / .to_pandas()。"

msgid "Vision / OCR"
msgstr "視覺 / OCR"

msgid "Image scale"
msgstr "影像縮放"

msgid "Upscale before OCR/layout. Try 2.0 for small screenshots."
msgstr "在 OCR/版面分析前進行放大。若為小型螢幕截圖，請嘗試 2.0。"

msgid "Worker timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "背景工作逾時 (秒)"

msgid "Host subprocess limit for Vision Helpers (first model download)."
msgstr "Vision Helpers 的主機子處理序限制 (首次下載模型時)。"

msgid "Docling artifacts path"
msgstr "Docling 產出物路徑"

msgid "Optional folder from docling-tools models download (offline use)."
msgstr "docling-tools 模型下載的可選資料夾（離線使用）。"

msgid "OCR confidence threshold"
msgstr "OCR 信心閾值"

msgid "RapidOCR minimum text score. Raise to reduce garbage text."
msgstr "RapidOCR 最低文字分數。提高此值可減少雜訊文字。"

msgid "OCR entire image"
msgstr "OCR 整張影像"

msgid "Recommended for embedded graphics exported from LibreOffice."
msgstr "建議用於從 LibreOffice 匯出的嵌入式圖形。"

msgid "Table extraction mode"
msgstr "表格擷取模式"

msgid "Accurate (default)"
msgstr "精確 (預設)"

msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快速"

msgid "Table cell matching"
msgstr "表格儲存格比對"

msgid "Align detected table cells with content (extract_structure)."
msgstr "將偵測到的表格儲存格與內容對齊 (extract_structure)。"

msgid "Keep orphan text clusters"
msgstr "保留孤立文字叢集"

msgid "Group unassigned text into clusters for messy layouts."
msgstr "將未指派的文字分組為叢集，以處理雜亂的版面配置。"

msgid "Document insert mode"
msgstr "文件插入模式"

msgid ""
"html = Docling HTML import (default). structured = bbox column layout in "
"Writer; native Calc cells for extract_structure tables."
msgstr ""
"html = Docling HTML 匯入（預設）。structured = Writer 中的 bbox 欄位配置；用"
"於 extract_structure 表格的原生 Calc 儲存格。"

msgid "Standard HTML"
msgstr "標準 HTML"

